<title>USA: Imperial Holly reinstates qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Imperial Holly reinstates qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SUGAR LAND, Texas 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Holly Corp said Friday that its board of directors has reinstated payment of quarterly dividends and declared a dividend of $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable August 13, 1997, to shareholders of record August 4, 1997.  </p>
<p>The previous dividend was $0.04 a share, paid on April 28, 1995.</p>
